    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/102600305/1026003050020"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "配慮が足りなかったことについて謝らせてくれ",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 1026003050030,
    "speaker": "ルカ",
    "text": "……",
    "charAnim1": "wait2",
    "charAnim2": "face_anger1",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_serious_s",
    "charLabel": "luca",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/102600305/1026003050030"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "ルカはずっとソロで活動してきて……",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "それこそカミサマって呼ばれるくらい、\r\n熱心なファンも多いのに",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "変化を望まない人がいるのは当たり前だよな",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 1026003050040,
    "speaker": "ルカ",
    "text": "……！",
    "charAnim1": "wait1",
    "charAnim2": "face_serious",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_sad_s",
    "charLabel": "luca",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/102600305/1026003050040"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "さっきみたいに──ルカだけに全部受け止めさせてしまって\r\n……本当に申し訳ない",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 1026003050050,
    "speaker": "ルカ",
    "text": "──やめろ\r\n勝手に許されようとすんな、いい子ちゃん",
    "charAnim1": "smile2",
    "charAnim2": "face_anger1",
    "charAnim4": "eye_right",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_serious",
    "charLabel": "luca",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/102600305/1026003050050"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "違っ",
    "charAnim2": "face_anger1",
    "charAnim4": "blank",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_serious_s",
    "charLabel": "luca",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002",
    "autoWaitTime": 300
  },
  {
    "id": 1026003050060,
    "speaker": "ルカ",
    "text": "違わねェだろ\r\n謝ろうが何しようが、この先ずっと変わんねぇんだよ",
    "charAnim1": "anger1",
    "charAnim2": "blank",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_sad",
    "charLabel": "luca",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/102600305/1026003050060"
  },
  {
    "id": 1026003050070,
    "speaker": "ルカ",
    "text": "……ソロでいようがユニットでいようが",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_sad",
    "charLabel": "luca",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/102600305/1026003050070"
  },
  {
    "id": 1026003050080,
    "speaker": "ルカ",
    "text": "他でもない私の手で、\r\n誰かから斑鳩ルカを奪ってるってことは",
    "charAnim1": "sad2",
    "charAnim2": "face_close2",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_sad",
    "charLabel": "luca",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/102600305/1026003050080"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "……すまない",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 1026003050090,
    "speaker": "ルカ",
    "text": "──だから",
    "charAnim1": "anger3",
    "charAnim2": "face_anger2",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_serious",
    "charLabel": "luca",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/102600305/1026003050090"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "それでも俺には、今の状況で見せられる誠意は\r\nこれだけなんだ",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 1026003050100,
    "speaker": "ルカ",
    "text": "……！",
    "charAnim1": "wait3",
    "charAnim2": "face_serious",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_sad_s",
    "charLabel": "luca",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/102600305/1026003050100"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "……悪かった。さっきは咄嗟に違うって言ったけど\r\n俺はルカに許してもらいたくて謝ってる",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "そうすることで楽になりたいって気持ちもある\r\nでも、それだけじゃなくて",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "今ルカが抱えているものは、\r\n俺が背負うべきはずのものだから",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 1026003050110,
    "speaker": "ルカ",
    "text": "あァ──？",
    "charAnim1": "anger2",
    "charAnim2": "face_anger2",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_sad",
    "charLabel": "luca",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/102600305/1026003050110"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "……ごめん、ルカ\r\nマネージャーさんと連絡を取ったんだ",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 1026003050120,
    "speaker": "ルカ",
    "text": "──────ッ…………！",
    "charAnim1": "surp2",
    "charAnim2": "blank",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_sad_s",
    "charLabel": "luca",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/102600305/1026003050120"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "ルカの大事な人なのに、\r\nルカを飛ばして勝手をして申し訳ない",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 1026003050130,
    "speaker": "ルカ",
    "text": "っ、だ、──何言って──！",
    "charAnim1": "surp1",
    "charAnim2": "blank",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_sad",
    "charLabel": "luca",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/102600305/1026003050130"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "ルカのことを聞かせてもらった\r\n俺の力不足で、俺がまだ理解できていないルカのこと",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "どうすればこれ以上──\r\nルカから何かを奪わずに済むのか",
    "charAnim1": "wait1",
    "charAnim2": "face_anger1",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_sad_s",
    "charLabel": "luca",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "ルカに何かを奪わせずに済むのか",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 1026003050140,
    "speaker": "ルカ",
    "text": "……！",
    "charAnim1": "wait2",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charAnim4": "eye_right",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_sad_s",
    "charLabel": "luca",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "bgm": "fade_out",
    "voice": "produce_events/102600305/1026003050140"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "マネージャーさんと話して、\r\n俺はそういうことを考えなきゃいけないんだって思った",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "……でも。悔しい限りだけど、俺は──\r\nルカを理解しているとは言えないから",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "ひとつずつ話をして、知っていきたいんだよ\r\nもう間違えないように──",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
